Alphabet
    %{A%}:а %{A%}:о
    %{M%}:0
    %{N%}:0
    %{a%}:а %{a%}:0
    >:>
    а:а о:о е:е и:и у:у э:э ы:ы ю:ю я:я х:х
    I:I I:Ӏ I:ӏ I:1
    ᴴ:ᴴ ᴴ:н н:н ;

Sets

Vowel = а е и о у э ы ю я ;

Rules

"The linking vowel of the plural oblique formant: -алу- after a consonant, -лу- after a vowel"
%{a%}:0 <=> Vowel >:> _ ;

"A is o before the masculine marker (-ов, -о) and before the neuter marker (-хоб)"
%{A%}:о <=> _ >:> [ %{M%}:0 | %{N%}:0 ] ;

"Remove the masculine archiphoneme"
%{M%}:0 <=> _ ;

"The neuter -об exists only after -ха (-хаб, -хоб): {N} is removed only there"
%{N%}:0 <=> х:х %{A%}:о >:> _ ;

"Palochka: the lexicon has I, the surface has I, Ӏ, ӏ or 1"
I:Ӏ => _ ;

"Nasal: the lexicon has ᴴ, the surface has ᴴ or н"
ᴴ:н => _ ;
